{
    "id": "5jwoj.berich",
    "name": "BeRich 订阅合集",
    "description": "包含京东Cookie同步、京豆资产查询、京东账号过期检测、阿里云Cookie同步和V2EX每日签到的BoxJS订阅合集",
    "author": "@5jwoj",
    "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/available.png",
    "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich",
    "apps": [
        {
            "id": "jd.cookie.sync.qx",
            "name": "京东Cookie同步",
            "keys": [
                "jd_ql_url",
                "jd_ql_client_id",
                "jd_ql_client_secret"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/JDCK",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">自动捕获京东Cookie并同步到青龙面板</h4>",
                "<p align=\"center\">使用说明请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/blob/main/JDCK/README_QX.md\">README_QX.md</a></p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，包括端口号"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client ID",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 -> 系统设置 -> 应用设置中创建应用获取"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 -> 系统设置 -> 应用设置中创建应用获取（权限需勾选环境变量）"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Cookie_Sync_QX.js"
        },
        {
            "id": "jd.bean.query.qx",
            "name": "京豆资产查询",
            "keys": [
                "jd_ql_url",
                "jd_ql_client_id",
                "jd_ql_client_secret",
                "jd_asset_script_name",
                "jd_local_pin"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/JDCK",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">基于青龙面板日志查询指定账号的京豆详情</h4>",
                "<p>读取青龙资产日志，精准过滤并展示指定的 Pin (或全部 Pin) 的京豆资产与收益情况。</p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板地址(含端口)，共享Cookie同步配置"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入 Client ID",
                    "desc": "青龙 Open API Client ID"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "青龙 Open API Client Secret"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_asset_script_name",
                    "name": "资产脚本名称",
                    "val": "jd_task_assets",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "jd_task_assets",
                    "desc": "青龙中运行资产查询的脚本文件名，默认 jd_task_assets"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_local_pin",
                    "name": "指定京东账号 Pin",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "例如: jd_123456 (多个用逗号分隔)",
                    "desc": "填写需要查询的京东 Pin (支持多个)，留空则输出日志中全部账号"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Bean_Query_QX.js"
        },
        {
            "id": "jd.cookie.check.qx",
            "name": "京东账号过期检测",
            "keys": [
                "jd_ql_url",
                "jd_ql_client_id",
                "jd_ql_client_secret",
                "jd_cookie_check_script",
                "jd_check_pin"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/JDCK",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/58xinian/icon/master/jd_sy.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">青龙京东账号 Cookie 过期 / 失效自动检测通知</h4>",
                "<p>自动读取青龙资产/签到日志，检测指定的 Pin (或全部 Pin) 是否失效，若过期则触发通知报警。</p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，包括端口号"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client ID",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 -> 系统设置 -> 应用设置中创建应用获取"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 -> 系统设置 -> 应用设置中创建应用获取"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_cookie_check_script",
                    "name": "检测目标脚本名称",
                    "val": "jd_task_assets",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "jd_task_assets",
                    "desc": "在青龙日志中检测的目标脚本名，默认 jd_task_assets"
                },
                {
                    "id": "jd_check_pin",
                    "name": "检测的京东账号 Pin",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "如: jd_123456,jd_789012",
                    "desc": "指定检测的京东账号 Pin，多个用逗号或空格分隔。留空则检测日志内全部账号"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/JDCK/JD_Cookie_Check_QX.js"
        },
        {
            "id": "aliyun.cookie.sync.qx",
            "name": "阿里云Cookie同步",
            "keys": [
                "ql_url",
                "ql_client_id",
                "ql_client_secret",
                "ql_data_name"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/aliyun",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/alipay.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/alipay.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">自动捕获阿里云社区Cookie并同步到青龙面板</h4>",
                "<p>获取方式：打开阿里云 APP → 首页 → 积分商城，触发抓包即可自动获取 Cookie。</p>",
                "<p>获取到的 Cookie 将保存至青龙面板变量 <code>aliyunWeb_data</code>（可自定义变量名）。</p>",
                "<p align=\"center\">使用说明请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/aliyun\">aliyun README</a></p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "ql_url",
                    "name": "青龙面板地址",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "http://192.168.1.1:5700",
                    "desc": "青龙面板的完整地址，包括端口号"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ql_client_id",
                    "name": "Client ID",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client ID",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 -> 系统设置 -> 应用设置中创建应用获取"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ql_client_secret",
                    "name": "Client Secret",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "请输入青龙面板的 Client Secret",
                    "desc": "在青龙面板 -> 系统设置 -> 应用设置中创建应用获取（权限需勾选环境变量）"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ql_data_name",
                    "name": "青龙变量名",
                    "val": "aliyunWeb_data",
                    "type": "text",
                    "placeholder": "aliyunWeb_data",
                    "desc": "存储到青龙面板的变量名，留空则使用默认值 aliyunWeb_data"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/aliyun/aliyun_web_cookie_qx.js"
        },
        {
            "id": "v2ex_daily_qx",
            "name": "V2EX 每日签到",
            "keys": [
                "v2ex_daily.cookie",
                "v2ex_daily.ua"
            ],
            "author": "@5jwoj",
            "repo": "https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/V2EX",
            "icons": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/v2ex.png",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Orz-3/mini/master/Color/v2ex.png"
            ],
            "descs_html": [
                "<h4 align=\"center\">自动领取 V2EX 每日登录奖励，签到后推送余额信息</h4>",
                "<p>使用方式：在下方填写 V2EX Cookie，然后在 Quantumult X 定时任务中添加脚本即可。</p>",
                "<p>多账号：将多个 Cookie 用<b>换行</b>分隔后填入同一文本框。</p>",
                "<p align=\"center\">使用说明请查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/5jwoj/BeRich/tree/main/V2EX\">V2EX README</a></p>"
            ],
            "settings": [
                {
                    "id": "v2ex_daily.cookie",
                    "name": "V2EX Cookie",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "textarea",
                    "autoGrow": true,
                    "rows": 3,
                    "desc": "登录 V2EX 后，从浏览器 F12 → Application → Cookies 复制完整 Cookie。多账号用换行分隔。"
                },
                {
                    "id": "v2ex_daily.ua",
                    "name": "User-Agent（可选）",
                    "val": "",
                    "type": "text",
                    "desc": "自定义请求 UA，留空则使用默认 Chrome UA"
                }
            ],
            "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/5jwoj/BeRich/main/V2EX/v2ex_daily.js"
        }
